<title>USA: McDonald's to open restaurant in Cyprus.</title>
<headline>McDonald's to open restaurant in Cyprus.</headline>
<dateline>OAK BROOK, Ill. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>McDonald's Corp said Wednesday that it planned to open its first restaurant in Cyprus.</p>
<p>McDonald's will open the restaurant at a beachfront location in the seaside city of Larnaca on Thursday.</p>
<p>With the opening, the company will have operations in 103 countries, it said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
